  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "KxVJgvi3fAg_qyZwr9M2s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -146.77165625296908,
      "y": -0.4678215123752558,
      "width": 872.5078051754598,
      "height": 475.91394683170023,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "rtOfO8MsuhPjjIspmmEuL"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2033995606,
      "version": 781,
      "versionNonce": 1340601546,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788625349188,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How electrical usage works ? \n\n- Power (W or Kw): how much energy the device uses per second\n- Energy (kWh): how much total energy the device uses over thime\n- Price per kwh: how much your utility charges for each kilowatt-hour used \n\n\nMachine = 1200 W = 1.2 KW\n\nOne hour usage: 1.2 KW x 1 H = 1.2 KWH\nOne minute usage: 1.2 KW x (1 / 60 H) = 0.02 KWH\n\nBuilding = Electricity Price = 0.30 / KWH\n\nCost for one hour: 1.2 KWH x 0.30 KWH = 0.36\nCost for one minute: 0.02 KWH x 0.30 KWH = 0.006\n\n",
      "fontSize": 21.151730970297788,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How electrical usage works ? \n\n- Power (W or Kw): how much energy the device uses per second\n- Energy (kWh): how much total energy the device uses over thime\n- Price per kwh: how much your utility charges for each kilowatt-hour used \n\n\nMachine = 1200 W = 1.2 KW\n\nOne hour usage: 1.2 KW x 1 H = 1.2 KWH\nOne minute usage: 1.2 KW x (1 / 60 H) = 0.02 KWH\n\nBuilding = Electricity Price = 0.30 / KWH\n\nCost for one hour: 1.2 KWH x 0.30 KWH = 0.36\nCost for one minute: 0.02 KWH x 0.30 KWH = 0.006\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "kg0VvCEJ3jG6AxuQ8r78O",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -147.22162567003784,
      "y": 460.844379033246,
      "width": 1104.5953369140625,
      "height": 475.91394683170023,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "rtOfO8MsuhPjjIspmmEuL"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 339200918,
      "version": 1169,
      "versionNonce": 999190794,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1788625501933,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements\n\n- Track daily/hourly energy consumption per device or room. \n- View trends over time. \n- Get alerts for anomalies (e.g. high consumption).\n- Receive AI-powered tips to reduce energy usage.\n- Simulate or accept IOT/Sensor data in real time. \n\nAssumptions\n\n- Users: 500k                                Total number of devices: 500K x 5 = 2.5 M\n- Devices per user: 5                        Readings per minute: 2.5M\n- Readings per device: 1 per minute          Readings per day: 3.6B\n- Each reading: 1 database insert            Size of each reading 72 bytes\n                                             Storage required per day = 3.6B x 72B = 259 GB/day\n                                             Storage required per month = 8 TB/month\n\n                                             Write throughput = 2.5M/60 = 41.6 inserts/second",
      "fontSize": 21.151730970297788,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements\n\n- Track daily/hourly energy consumption per device or room. \n- View trends over time. \n- Get alerts for anomalies (e.g. high consumption).\n- Receive AI-powered tips to reduce energy usage.\n- Simulate or accept IOT/Sensor data in real time. \n\nAssumptions\n\n- Users: 500k                                Total number of devices: 500K x 5 = 2.5 M\n- Devices per user: 5                        Readings per minute: 2.5M\n- Readings per device: 1 per minute          Readings per day: 3.6B\n- Each reading: 1 database insert            Size of each reading 72 bytes\n                                             Storage required per day = 3.6B x 72B = 259 GB/day\n                                             Storage required per month = 8 TB/month\n\n                                             Write throughput = 2.5M/60 = 41.6 inserts/second",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
